          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುಚ್ಚಳ (muccaḷa) is native Dravidian, from muccu, \"to close, cover\", and DEDR 4915 lists muccaḷa, \"covering, lid\", itself; the entry also has Tamil muccu and Telugu mūyu."
            }
